  "releaseNotes": "Inverts ConfigContraband from a purely reactive linter into an authoring tool: the new ConfigContraband.Tool package generates appsettings.schema.json from your options types so editors give live autocomplete, type checking, required-key hints, and unknown-key warnings while you edit appsettings.json. The analyzer's bindable-property model now lives in a shared ConfigContraband.Core library (bundled with the analyzer); diagnostics CFG001-CFG007 are unchanged.",
